WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.334
The robot arm approaches the blue rectangular object (salad dressing) on the table from above, grasps it, lifts it, and moves it to the left to place it into the woven basket.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Move arm down and right to approach the blue object on the table from above.

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Close gripper to grasp the blue object.

4
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Lift the object and move it left towards the basket.

5
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Lower the object into the basket and open the gripper to release it.

6
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Retract arm upwards and away from the basket.
